  "type": "Collection",
  "title": "Sentinel-1 Level-1 SLC (Zarr3 staging)",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "The Sentinel-1 Level-1 Single Look Complex (SLC) products consist of focused SAR data, geo-referenced using orbit and attitude data from the satellite, and provided in slant-range geometry. Slant range is the natural radar range observation coordinate, defined as the line-of-sight from the radar to each reflecting object. The products are in zero-Doppler orientation where each row of pixels represents points along a line perpendicular to the sub-satellite track.",
